Subject: [PATCH] feat: show tele server usernames

Port of tele 0093: aliases from the feed's usernames section are inserted into the profile username list of users and channels at their feed position, @alias opens the real username, @-mention suggestions offer the alias owner, and @alias in a sent message becomes the real mention. Inline bots resolve server aliases too (0124). Display-only, peer objects stay untouched; local aliases (0072) take precedence. Alias replacement now leaves code, links and partly formatted tokens alone and shifts the remaining entities. Toggle: usernames from the server (on by default). Replaces the dead applyUsernames from 0074.
